msgid ""
"The H16 Smart Remote Control is a UAV communication link that integrates "
"remote control, data transmission, and HD video transmission. It runs the "
"Android operating system and supports mainstream ground stations such as "
"QGC; Like an Android phone, you can install other Android applications as "
"desired ."
msgstr ""
"H16 智能遥控器是一款集遥控、数据传输和高清视频传输于一体的无人机通信链路。运行 Android 操作系统，支持 QGC 等主流地面站；像 "
"Android 手机一样，可以根据需要安装其他 Android 应用程序。"

