#: d71b93c90da04ba8ab40d5d9050a9ce7
msgid ""
"The DJI OcuSync Air System is an integrated high-resolution video "
"transmission solution consisting of a camera, Air Unit module, three "
"antennas, and other connectors. Working with DJI Goggles RE, the OcuSync Air"
" System supports wireless transmission of video, images, and autopilot "
"information."
msgstr ""
"DJI OcuSync 空中系统是一套集成高分辨率视频传输解决方案，由摄像头、Air Unit 模块、三根天线和其他连接器组成。配合 DJI "
"Goggles RE 使用，OcuSync 空中系统支持视频、图像和飞控信息的无线传输。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-video-landingpage.rst:95
